    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel \"temporary\"... that's the thing. it's not like i'm just in a bad mood. it's like the person who would actually benefit from \"finding a path forward\" literally doesn't exist anymore. the version of me that had a future and a personality... that person is just gone. i'm just a shell performing the mechanics of a life. how can i \"find a path\" when there's no one left to walk it?",
